#: data/maps/Route111_OldLadysRestStop/scripts.inc:31
msgctxt "Route111_OldLadysRestStop_Text_RestUpHere"
msgid ""
"Oh, dear, dear.\n"
"Aren't your POKéMON exhausted?\p"
"If you'd like, rest up here.\n"
"That's a fine idea! You should do that.$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀呀，你的宝可梦是不是累坏了？\p"
"如果你愿意的话，就在这里休息一下吧。\n"
"这主意不错！你就这么做吧。$"

#: data/maps/Route111_OldLadysRestStop/scripts.inc:37
msgctxt "Route111_OldLadysRestStop_Text_TakeYourTimeRestUp"
msgid ""
"That's right.\n"
"Take your time and rest up!$"
msgstr "对，对。慢慢休息吧！$"

#: data/maps/Route111_OldLadysRestStop/scripts.inc:41
msgctxt "Route111_OldLadysRestStop_Text_StillTiredTakeAnotherRest"
msgid ""
"Oh, dear, dear.\n"
"Are your POKéMON still tired?\p"
"You should take another rest here.\n"
"That's a fine idea. You should do that.$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀呀，你的宝可梦还很累吗？\p"
"你应该在这里再休息一下。\n"
"这主意不错。你就这么做吧。$"

#: data/maps/Route111_OldLadysRestStop/scripts.inc:47
msgctxt "Route111_OldLadysRestStop_Text_DontNeedToBeShy"
msgid ""
"Is that so?\n"
"You don't need to be shy about it.$"
msgstr "是吗？不用跟我客气哦。$"
